rse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja440:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja440:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja440:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:11.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:11.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja440:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja440:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:13.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja440:13.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja440:14.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja440:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja440:0.2": "Dasakanipāta ", "ja440:0.3": "Catudvāravagga ", "ja440:0.4": "2. Kaṇhajātaka ", "ja440:1.1": "“Kaṇho vatāyaṁ puriso, ", "ja440:1.2": "kaṇhaṁ bhuñjati bhojanaṁ; ", "ja440:1.3": "Kaṇhe bhūmipadesasmiṁ, ", "ja440:1.4": "na mayhaṁ manaso piyo”. ", "ja440:2.1": "“Na kaṇho tacasā hoti, ", "ja440:2.2": "antosāro hi brāhmaṇo; ", "ja440:2.3": "Yasmiṁ pāpāni kammāni, ", "ja440:2.4": "sa ve kaṇho sujampati”. ", "ja440:3.1": "“Etasmiṁ te sulapite, ", "ja440:3.2": "patirūpe subhāsite; ", "ja440:3.3": "Varaṁ brāhmaṇa te dammi, ", "ja440:3.4": "yaṁ kiñci manasicchasi”. ", "ja440:4.1": "“Varañce me ado sakka, ", "ja440:4.2": "sabbabhūtānamissara; ", "ja440:4.3": "Sunikkodhaṁ suniddosaṁ, ", "ja440:4.4": "nillobhaṁ vuttimattano; ", "ja440:4.5": "Nisnehamabhikaṅkhāmi, ", "ja440:4.6": "ete me caturo vare”. ", "ja440:5.1": "“Kiṁ nu kodhe vā dose vā, ", "ja440:5.2": "lobhe snehe ca brāhmaṇa; ", "ja440:5.3": "Ādīnavaṁ tvaṁ passasi, ", "ja440:5.4": "taṁ me akkhāhi pucchito”. ", "ja440:6.1": "“Appo hutvā bahu hoti, ", "ja440:6.2": "vaḍḍhate so akhantijo; ", "ja440:6.3": "Āsaṅgī bahupāyāso, ", "ja440:6.4": "tasmā kodhaṁ na rocaye. ", "ja440:7.1": "Duṭṭhassa pharusā vācā, ", "ja440:7.2": "parāmāso anantarā; ", "ja440:7.3": "Tato pāṇi tato daṇḍo, ", "ja440:7.4": "satthassa paramā gati; ", "ja440:7.5": "Doso kodhasamuṭṭhāno, ", "ja440:7.6": "tasmā dosaṁ na rocaye. ", "ja440:8.1": "Ālopa sāhasākārā, ", "ja440:8.2": "nikatī vañcanāni ca; ", "ja440:8.3": "Dissanti lobhadhammesu, ", "ja440:8.4": "tasmā lobhaṁ na rocaye. ", "ja440:9.1": "Snehasaṅgathitā ganthā, ", "ja440:9.2": "senti manomayā puthū; ", "ja440:9.3": "Te bhusaṁ upatāpenti, ", "ja440:9.4": "tasmā snehaṁ na rocaye”. ", "ja440:10.1": "“Etasmiṁ te sulapite, ", "ja440:10.2": "patirūpe subhāsite; ", "ja440:10.3": "Varaṁ brāhmaṇa te dammi, ", "ja440:10.4": "yaṁ kiñci manasicchasi”. ", "ja440:11.1": "“Varañce me ado sakka, ", "ja440:11.2": "sabbabhūtānamissara; ", "ja440:11.3": "Araññe me viharato, ", "ja440:11.4": "niccaṁ ekavihārino; ", "ja440:11.5": "Ābādhā mā uppajjeyyuṁ, ", "ja440:11.6": "antarāyakarā bhusā”. ", "ja440:12.1": "“Etasmiṁ te sulapite, ", "ja440:12.2": "patirūpe subhāsite; ", "ja440:12.3": "Varaṁ brāhmaṇa te dammi, ", "ja440:12.4": "yaṁ kiñci manasicchasi”. ", "ja440:13.1": "“Varañce me ado sakka, ", "ja440:13.2": "sabbabhūtānamissara; ", "ja440:13.3": "Na mano vā sarīraṁ vā, ", "ja440:13.4": "maṁ-kate sakka kassaci; ", "ja440:13.5": "Kadāci upahaññetha, ", "ja440:13.6": "etaṁ sakka varaṁ vare”ti. ", "ja440:14.1": "Kaṇhajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja440:0.1": "", "ja440:0.2": "", "ja440:0.3": "", "ja440:0.4": "", "ja440:1.1": "", "ja440:1.2": "", "ja440:1.3": "", "ja440:1.4": "", "ja440:2.1": "", "ja440:2.2": "", "ja440:2.3": "mā → na (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja440:2.4": "", "ja440:3.1": "", "ja440:3.2": "", "ja440:3.3": "", "ja440:3.4": "", "ja440:4.1": "", "ja440:4.2": "", "ja440:4.3": "", "ja440:4.4": "", "ja440:4.5": "", "ja440:4.6": "", "ja440:5.1": "kodhe vā → kodhe ca (bj); kodheva (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja440:5.2": "", "ja440:5.3": "tvaṁ passasi → sampassasi (bj, pts-vp-pli1); sammasasi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja440:5.4": "", "ja440:6.1": "", "ja440:6.2": "", "ja440:6.3": "", "ja440:6.4": "", "ja440:7.1": "pharusā → paṭhamā (pts-vp-pli1, bj -nissya) ", "ja440:7.2": "", "ja440:7.3": "", "ja440:7.4": "paramā gati → parāmasati (mr) ", "ja440:7.5": "", "ja440:7.6": "", "ja440:8.1": "sāhasākārā → sahasākārā (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja440:8.2": "", "ja440:8.3": "", "ja440:8.4": "", "ja440:9.1": "Snehasaṅgathitā → saṅgantitā (sya1ed); saṅgadhitā (mr) ", "ja440:9.2": "", "ja440:9.3": "", "ja440:9.4": "", "ja440:10.1": "", "ja440:10.2": "", "ja440:10.3": "", "ja440:10.4": "", "ja440:11.1": "", "ja440:11.2": "", "ja440:11.3": "", "ja440:11.4": "", "ja440:11.5": "", "ja440:11.6": "", "ja440:12.1": "", "ja440:12.2": "", "ja440:12.3": "", "ja440:12.4": "", "ja440:13.1": "", "ja440:13.2": "", "ja440:13.3": "", "ja440:13.4": "", "ja440:13.5": "", "ja440:13.6": "", "ja440:14.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja440:0.1": "", "ja440:0.2": "", "ja440:0.3": "", "ja440:0.4": "", "ja440:1.1": "csp1ed22.202, csp2ed22.202, ms22J_1920, msdiv11, pts-vp-pli4.9, vri68.164", "ja440:1.2": "", "ja440:1.3": "", "ja440:1.4": "", "ja440:2.1": "bj30.350, ms22J_1921, msdiv12", "ja440:2.2": "", "ja440:2.3": "", "ja440:2.4": "", "ja440:3.1": "ms22J_1922, msdiv13, pts-vp-pli4.10", "ja440:3.2": "", "ja440:3.3": "", "ja440:3.4": "", "ja440:4.1": "ms22J_1923, msdiv14", "ja440:4.